  "description": "IROKEJ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C135 H89 Gd4 N1 O26,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.766-3.875 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.92-109.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C135H95NO29Gd4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
